# OPTIONAL developer-only overrides for local testing.
#
# In normal use you do NOT put your key here. Enter it in the app's Settings
# screen, where it is encrypted at rest with your OS keychain (safeStorage).
#
# These variables are read ONLY in the Electron main process (never exposed to
# the renderer / frontend), and only used as a fallback if no key is stored.

# STEAM_API_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# BATTLEMETRICS_API_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
